    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Software-Technology-Course-Blog"><a href="#Software-Technology-Course-Blog" class="headerlink" title="Software Technology Course Blog"></a>Software Technology Course Blog</h1><p>This repository contains my personal static blog website built for the course <em>Fundamentals of Software Technology</em>.</p><p>The blog integrates previous assignments and demonstrates the process of building and deploying a static website using Hexo and Git.</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
